This repository contains code from two upstream sources, both Apache-2.0:

1. The gateway, from the SGLang project (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang),
   directory `sgl-model-gateway/` at tag v0.5.15.post1.
2. `crates/openai-protocol`, from the crates.io package `openai-protocol` 1.0.0,
   published by the same maintainers.

Modifications made in this fork, as required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b):

- `crates/openai-protocol/src/generate.rs`: declared the SGLang `/generate` fields
  `return_routed_experts`, `routed_experts_start_len`, `return_prompt_token_ids` and
  `return_processor_outputs`.
- `crates/openai-protocol/src/chat.rs`: declared the SGLang `/v1/chat/completions`
  fields `return_prompt_token_ids`, `return_meta_info`, `return_routed_experts`,
  `routed_experts_start_len`, `return_cached_tokens_details` and
  `return_processor_outputs`.
- `crates/openai-protocol/src/common.rs`: tool call `arguments` accepts a JSON object
  in addition to the OpenAI JSON string.
- `Cargo.toml`: workspace member and `[patch.crates-io]` entry for the in-tree
  `openai-protocol`.
- `LICENSE`: replaced the monorepo-relative symlink with the license text.
- Tests and benches updated for the added fields; the wheel version carries a
  `.post<n>` suffix marking this fork's patch revision.

See FORK.md for the full rationale and the upstream resync procedure.
